paragraph 22(5) of Schedule 10 to the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987

S.I. 1987/1967, to which there are amendments not relevant to these Regulations.
								 (capital to be disregarded);

paragraph 27(5) of Schedule 8 to the Jobseeker’s Allowance Regulations 1996

S.I. 1996/207, to which there are amendments not relevant to these Regulations.
								 (capital to be disregarded);

paragraph 15(5) of Schedule 5 to the State Pension Credit Regulations 2002

S.I. 2002/1792, to which there are amendments not relevant to these Regulations.
								 (Part 1 - capital disregarded for the purpose of calculating income);

paragraph 24(5) of Schedule 6 to the Housing Benefit Regulations 2006

S.I. 2006/213, to which there are amendments not relevant to these Regulations.
								 (capital to be disregarded);

paragraph 16(5) of Schedule 6 to the Housing Benefit (persons who have attained the qualifying age for state pension credit) Regulations 2006

S.I. 2006/214, to which there are amendments not relevant to these Regulations.
								 (Part 1 - capital to be disregarded generally);
